    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jon\u00e1s is an otaku who lives peacefully watching anime and reading manga.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one fateful day, he discovers online that his city has been ravaged by a mysterious virus that turns people into zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The city is under quarantine,&quot;</strong> the online news says...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And soon, it will be wiped out by an airstrike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Jon\u00e1s must face the horror...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's clumsy, slow, and can barely run a few meters without needing a break.<br>Armed only with his wits (and whatever junk he finds), he must fight off hordes of zombies and mutant monsters in a pixelated city full of horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find stronger weapons to kill the undead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve absurd puzzles set by a &quot;jerk&quot; in the police station.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the survivors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape underground laboratories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the dark truth behind the cursed city's fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this in a retro-style pixelated world, with Japanese voiceovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parody of classic survival horror games, full of humor and terror.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jon\u00e1s is an otaku who lives peacefully watching anime and reading manga.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one fateful day, he discovers online that his city has been ravaged by a mysterious virus that turns people into zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The city is under quarantine,&quot;</strong> the online news says...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And soon, it will be wiped out by an airstrike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Jon\u00e1s must face the horror...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's clumsy, slow, and can barely run a few meters without needing a break.<br>Armed only with his wits (and whatever junk he finds), he must fight off hordes of zombies and mutant monsters in a pixelated city full of horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find stronger weapons to kill the undead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve absurd puzzles set by a &quot;jerk&quot; in the police station.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the survivors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape underground laboratories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the dark truth behind the cursed city's fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this in a retro-style pixelated world, with Japanese voiceovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parody of classic survival horror games, full of humor and terror.</p>",
